### Cloud LLM Hub - Cloud (BTP) Testing Template
### Template file - copy to scratch/ for testing
### Replace {{appName}} and {{region}} with your actual values

@baseUrl = https://{{appName}}.cfapps.{{region}}.hana.ondemand.com
@authBearer = Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Variables - Update these with your values
@appName = cloud-llm-hub-srv
@region = eu10
@destination = SAP_DEV_DEST
@message = Hello! Can you introduce yourself?
@jwtToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

##########################################
# Authentication
##########################################

### Get XSUAA Token (Client Credentials)
# Replace {{clientId}} and {{clientSecret}} with values from VCAP_SERVICES
POST https://{{subdomain}}.authentication.{{region}}.hana.ondemand.com/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

### Get XSUAA Token (Password Grant - for testing)
# Replace {{username}} and {{password}} with your BTP user credentials
POST https://{{subdomain}}.authentication.{{region}}.hana.ondemand.com/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username={{username}}&password={{password}}&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

##########################################
# MCP Proxy Service (OData V4)
##########################################

### Health Check - MCP Proxy
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/mcp/Health()
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Probe Destination
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/mcp/ProbeDestination?destination={{destination}}
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Probe Destination (positional parameter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/mcp/ProbeDestination(destination='{{destination}}')
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

##########################################
# Agent Service (OData V4)
##########################################

### Agent Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/agent/Health()
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Agent Chat - Send Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/agent/Chat
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "{{message}}"
}

### Agent Chat - Get History
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/agent/GetHistory()
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Agent Chat - Clear History
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/agent/ClearHistory
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

##########################################
# MCP Streaming Endpoints (Express)
##########################################

### MCP Stream SSE (Server-Sent Events)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/stream/sse
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### MCP Stream HTTP (NDJSON) - Ping
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp/stream/http
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-MCP-Timeout: 60000

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"1","method":"ping"}

### MCP Stream HTTP - Initialize
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp/stream/http
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-SAP-Destination: {{destination}}
X-MCP-Timeout: 60000

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"1","method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2024-11-05","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"test-client","version":"1.0.0"}}}

### MCP Stream HTTP - List Tools
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp/stream/http
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-SAP-Destination: {{destination}}
X-MCP-Timeout: 60000

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"2","method":"tools/list"}

### MCP Stream HTTP - Get Includes List
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp/stream/http
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-SAP-Destination: {{destination}}
X-MCP-Timeout: 60000

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"3","method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"GetIncludesList","arguments":{"objectName":"ZCL_TEST","objectType":"CLAS"}}}

##########################################
# Auth Service (OData V4)
##########################################

### Check Auth
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/auth/CheckAuth()
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Check Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/auth/CheckRoles?required=["MCP_Connector"]
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Check Roles (positional parameter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/auth/CheckRoles(required=['MCP_Connector'])
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

##########################################
# Error Testing
##########################################

### Health Check - No Auth (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/mcp/Health()
Accept: application/json

### Health Check - Invalid Token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/mcp/Health()
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here
Accept: application/json

### Probe Destination - Invalid Destination (should return error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/mcp/ProbeDestination?destination=INVALID_DEST
Authorization: {{authBearer}}
Accept: application/json

